WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.710
- Alright I'm gonna close this hour out

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.880
with a holiday story that's
sure to make you smile.

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:04.925
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:04.925 --> 00:00:08.050
(energetic music)

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:08.883
- [Kelly] Earlier this year,

00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:11.510
Schleich Toys posted
an unusual job opening,

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:13.850
Chief Storytelling Officer.

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:15.490
They wanted a kid who could make their

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.740
animals and place that's come to life.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.790
So kids everywhere lined up for the role,

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.970
including eight year old Marcello,

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:24.650
who was first in line at the auditions

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:26.670
at FAO Schwarz in the Big Apple.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:29.260
He must've set the bar high
for the other boys and girls

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:33.530
because he landed the
gig, along with $10,000.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:34.441
We have, what?

00:00:34.441 --> 00:00:36.570
We have the CSO on the line,

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:38.220
along with his proud mama, Tiffany.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.310
So Marcello. Congratulations.

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:43.060
(crowd cheering)

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.260
Hello. Well, congratulations.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:49.140
So how did you get the job?
What story did you tell?

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.500
- [Marcello] I actually told two stories.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.950
My first one was about a
dinosaur birthday party.

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:57.830
So all these animals went back in time.

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:00.140
So for all the dinosaur birthday party,

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:03.430
so they got him a cake and
they asked what'd you wish for.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:05.700
And he said, my wish already came true,

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:07.798
for having wonderful friends like you.

00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:10.140
(crowd awws)
- [Kelly] Oh my Gosh.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.020
You are so cute. Oh my Gosh.

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:14.890
How proud are you mama?

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:16.900
- [Tiffany] I am so proud. Honestly,

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:19.910
it's been such an incredible
journey for Marcello.

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:23.320
I mean, he has the biggest,
most wildest imagination.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:25.500
So this is the perfect gig for him.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.700
And the judges didn't know it,

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.660
last year that he was so sick.

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:32.260
He had strep infection,
it went to his brain.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.890
He had rocky mountain spotted fever

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:36.240
and he had COVID all at once.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.930
So it was like the craziest time for us.

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:40.450
We didn't know if we'd ever get him back.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:43.510
Our talkative little boy,
he has come full circle.

00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:45.633
We are so proud of him.
And now he's helping like,

00:01:45.633 --> 00:01:47.200
(crowd cheering)
- [Kelly] Wow

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.550
- Do all these amazing things.

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:50.520
So we're so proud of him.

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:51.353
- [Kelly] I mean, what a,

00:01:51.353 --> 00:01:52.430
what a warrior.

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:55.040
My sister literally is the only
person on the planet that I,

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.240
that I know that has had
rocky mountain spotted fever.

00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:58.820
I'd never even heard about it before that.

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:01.750
And it's horrible. So God,
all those things at once man,

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.373
way to go survive. And that
you're a little warrior.

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:07.760
Way to go.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:08.936
Well, thank you so much,

00:02:08.936 --> 00:02:10.940
Marcello and Tiffany, congrats.

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:13.081
And I'm liking your post right now, right?

00:02:13.081 --> 00:02:15.199
(crowd cheering)

00:02:15.199 --> 00:02:17.280
And that's not how our
season long partner,

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:18.890
Pilot Pen makers of FriXion,

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:21.140
the go-to erasable pen at
the Kelly Clarkson Show

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:23.460
wanna celebrate those creating fearlessly

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:24.640
and telling great stories.

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:25.730
Just like you Marcello.

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:27.560
So they're giving you a $1000.

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:28.571
How's that sound?

00:02:28.571 --> 00:02:30.334
(crowd cheering)

00:02:30.334 --> 00:02:32.501
- Oh my Gosh, look at you.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:36.390
- [Kelly] Alright thank you
all so much. Merry Christmas.

